ow exactly how 2e fatebinding works, but If we're talking 1e rules then the gods would likely end up completely and utterly fatebound to the mortals who worshipped them if they did that. IIRC that was pretty much stated as being why they took such a hands off approach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":20546,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20546-dragonchild","user":"Dragonchild","date":". 03-17-2019, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20546-dragonchild","name":"Dragonchild","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}